pi.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3986249327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109459#issuecomment-3986249327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459","id":3986249327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tmVZv","user":{"login":"dpiquet","id":4688628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2ODg2Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4688628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet","html_url":"https://github.com/dpiquet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-02T18:56:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-02T19:19:44Z","body":"Note: per instance parameter is also lost when baking static mesh from csg node","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3986249327/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4000459255","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109459#issuecomment-4000459255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459","id":4000459255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ucin3","user":{"login":"dpiquet","id":4688628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2ODg2Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4688628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet","html_url":"https://github.com/dpiquet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpiquet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T21:37:38Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T21:37:38Z","body":"Played some debugger tonight.\n\nI think that, for the export part of the problem at least, the issue lies in visual_instance_3d.cpp\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/3d/visual_instance_3d.cpp#L355\n\n`RS::get_singleton()->instance_geometry_get_shader_parameter_list(get_instance(), &pinfo);`\n\nIn the case of a CSG node, this returns an empty list for pinfo at export time. Probably an RID issue ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4000459255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5487364566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109459#issuecomment-5487364566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459","id":5487364566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRxKJ1g","user":{"login":"hypotensor","id":184009339,"node_id":"U_kgDOCvfCew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184009339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor","html_url":"https://github.com/hypotensor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypotensor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T01:36:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T01:36:17Z","body":"Not sure if related but I've just encountered an issue where CSG with multiple materials does not have any per instance uniforms in the editor. Calling `set_instance_shader_parameter` and `get_instance_shader_parameter` behaves like normal with the getter returning the expected value, however there is no visual change and the shader just renders with the default value.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5487364566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5527538128","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109459#issuecomment-5527538128","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459","id":5527538128,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSXeJ0A","user":{"login":"billuo","id":43804776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODA0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43804776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo","html_url":"https://github.com/billuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T14:48:34Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T14:50:53Z","body":"Here's a workaround for anyone in a hurry:\n- Disable in Project Settings \"editor/export/convert_text_resources_to_binary\"\n- Avoid letting any EditorExportPlugin affect scenes that directly contain CSG nodes\n\nEssentially, do not go into the following block of code. \nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6ef60dc279b2c58a94ffc57bf98eefc9663f7907/editor/export/editor_export_platform.cpp#L1086-L1097\nThe root cause is how CSG shapes defers creating meshes and their materials, combined with how binary export is enabled by default. For binary export, `p_force_save` will be true, thus the whole scene is repacked based on the instantiated node tree. In this process only proerties reported by `Object::get_property_list()` will be serialized again. Given that CSG shapes defer calling `update_shape()` in `_make_dirty()`, in this newly created tree that's never processed, they have no materials associated and will not report themselves having instance shader parameters. The result is that in the exported .scn file, the uniform is simply missing, which can be verified by dumping the PackedScene in export with `PackedScene.get_state()`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5527538128/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]